   +sg('p')+'Gared sh.14 of 19, Unit 7 Rev A 12/12/23: hanger 24\'-9 3/16"; board face to hanger 0\'-10 13/16"; rear back-span 13\'-5 15/16"; fold height 18\'-4 1/2"; rim 8\'-0"/10\'-0". Stamped "not required for field check." '
   +sg('p')+'3-A511: 84\'-0", 50\'-0", 36" border, 48" to board face, 63" to basket center. '
   +sg('p')+'3-A115: 12\'-8" to the inner boundary of striping, both ends. '
   +sg('p')+'Gared sh.16: beam clamp 1684-02-08, 26,000 lb at failure against 1,846 lb at Node 7, typical all connections to beams. '
   +sg('f')+'Field, per JP: 46 7/8" + 5/8" to the top of framing; room 74\'-8"; pilaster string 9\'-8", 20\', 20\', 20\', 20\', 16\'-8"; pilaster depth 3\'-4"; CMU wrap stops about 1\'-0" below steel; reframe isolated to the 16\'-8" panel. '
   +sg('m')+'Markups on 3-A307/C1, not printed: 20\'-1 1/2" and 17\'-9 3/4" soffit elevations; 20\'-0 1/4" CMU to column; 9\'-7 3/4" south beam break. '
   +sg('m')+'<b>The 14\'-8" radius to the mast low point is not printed anywhere.</b> It is the red 14\'-7 31/32" markup plus scaling, and it is the most load-bearing number here. '
   +sg('a')+'Assumptions: 2\'-6" board face to rim lip; fold height measured to the rim lip; framing solid to the floor; constant radius; 5/8" wall finish; 3" clearance; 10" minimum rear attachment. '
   +sg('a')+'The 20\'-0" stowed clearance appears only in a vendor email of 8/26/26, with no spec citation, and contradicts the 18\'-4 1/2" on the vendor\'s own sheet.';
}
draw();
